        <mxCell id="config" value="&lt;b&gt;BUILD INPUT&lt;/b&gt;  Yocto SCP_PLATFORM=apollo-qvp이며 PMIC=ON, SCMI performance fast channels=OFF를 전달한다. Firmware.cmake는 PMIC probe 이후 PPU/SYS0 power-on이 오도록 모듈 순서를 조정한다." parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#172C43;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;spacing=12;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#172C43;">
